## The flow — one line

Every feature is one directory, `specs/NNN-<name>/`: spec → clarify → plan → tasks → analyze →
implement → converge ([SPEC-FLOW](../model/SPEC-FLOW.md)). **HARD-GATE: no code before the
spec is approved.**

## The gate chain — one line

`[format] && [static-analysis] && [tests] && [build] && [orphan-endpoint] &&
[third-person-acceptance] && [doc-sync]` before every commit; no commit on red, no exceptions
([GATES](../gates/GATES.md)).

